{"id":"n80272-2-6","stage":4,"title":"탁하다 · 阴沉","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80272-2-6-1","ko":"나는 지수에게 말을 잘 못 걸겠어.","zh":"我实在不知道该怎么跟智秀开口说话。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"지수에게","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"지수에게","audio":"/audio/68c8076b719ae97f43a2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수에게","audio":"/audio/68c8076b719ae97f43a2.mp3"}},{"text":"말을","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말을","audio":"/audio/e897e0419e4ab64902fd.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"걸겠어.","meaning":"谈，开，寻，搞","explanation":"걸다：谈，开，寻，搞；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"걸다","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65528","senseId":"13","lemma":"걸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸겠어","audio":"/audio/ea5f2c5100b9bf4bb5cc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"a44925f8d8720a55","term":"걸다","zh":"谈，开，寻，搞","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3","entryId":"65528","definition":"向别人先采取某种行动。","pronunciation":["걸ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7c7f155c92f20b8f6cb7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80272-2-6-2","ko":"나도 그래. 지수를 보면 탁하고 어두운 느낌이 들어.","zh":"我也是。一看到智秀，我就觉得心里闷闷的、很压抑。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"지수를","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지수를","audio":"/audio/e9f75725b9488ce72144.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수를","audio":"/audio/e9f75725b9488ce72144.mp3"}},{"text":"보면","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보면","audio":"/audio/35629c9db8f201235337.mp3"}},{"text":"탁하고","meaning":"阴沉","explanation":"탁하다：阴沉；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"탁하다","audio":"/audio/d9d027942a5d13028221.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80272","senseId":"2","lemma":"탁하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"탁하고","audio":"/audio/5d1be4f3a59be3c0d9eb.mp3"}},{"text":"어두운","meaning":"阴暗，阴沉","explanation":"어둡다：阴暗，阴沉；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어둡다","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89860","senseId":"3","lemma":"어둡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어두운","audio":"/audio/437e6a7b71817e553167.mp3"}},{"text":"느낌이","meaning":"感觉，感受","explanation":"느낌：感觉，感受；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"느낌","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61166","senseId":"1","lemma":"느낌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느낌이","audio":"/audio/160aa45adfe9857278de.mp3"}},{"text":"들어.","meaning":"有，感到","explanation":"들다：有，感到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"23","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어","audio":"/audio/079c88dfcd6e6363232f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"d9d027942a5d1302","term":"탁하다","zh":"阴沉","audio":"/audio/d9d027942a5d13028221.mp3","entryId":"80272","definition":"表情很阴暗。","pronunciation":["타카다"]},{"id":"ced8d3736f75b7c3","term":"어둡다","zh":"阴暗，阴沉","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3","entryId":"89860","definition":"气氛、表情、性格等低落消沉。","pronunciation":["어둡따"]},{"id":"f376240a37fbad98","term":"느낌","zh":"感觉，感受","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3","entryId":"61166","definition":"身体或内心产生的情绪或情感。","pronunciation":["느낌"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"有，感到","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"对某物产生想法或感觉。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7ece52a2aed6d47b9dd5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.955,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80272","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":142,"sequenceScore":2.7817,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我也是。一看到智秀，我就觉得心里闷闷的、很压抑。","音响突然不能用了，能帮我看看吗？","我实在不知道该怎么跟智秀开口说话。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我也是。一看到智秀，我就觉得心里闷闷的、很压抑。","我实在不知道该怎么跟智秀开口说话。","音响突然不能用了，能帮我看看吗？"],"answer":0}]}
